+iCons(49,.IntSeq) #Equals decimalCodes(1)
+```
+
+The `[2]` residual in
+[04-kprove-rejected-two.log](/audit-output/evidence/04-kprove-rejected-two.log)
+reaches a returned list containing `2` under:
+
+```text
